{"page":10,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:62","surah":2,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَٱلَّذِينَ هَادُوا۟ وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ وَٱلصَّـٰبِـِٔينَ مَنْ ءَامَنَ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ وَعَمِلَ صَـٰلِحًا فَلَهُمْ أَجْرُهُمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ وَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The [Muslim] believers, the Jews, the Christians, and the Sabians- all those who believe in God and the Last Day and do good- will have their rewards with their Lord. No fear for them, nor will they grieve.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هَادُوا۟","en_gloss":"became Jews","transliteration":"hādū","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ","en_gloss":"and the Christians","transliteration":"wal-naṣārā","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلصَّـٰبِـِٔينَ","en_gloss":"and the Sabians ","transliteration":"wal-ṣābiīna","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَامَنَ","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmana","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"and the Day","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","en_gloss":"[the] Last","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَعَمِلَ","en_gloss":"and did","transliteration":"waʿamila","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":14,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"2:62"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"so for them","t