8","surah":2,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ ٱدْعُ لَنَا رَبَّكَ يُبَيِّن لَّنَا مَا هِىَ ۚ قَالَ إِنَّهُۥ يَقُولُ إِنَّهَا بَقَرَةٌ لَّا فَارِضٌ وَلَا بِكْرٌ عَوَانٌۢ بَيْنَ ذَٰلِكَ ۖ فَٱفْعَلُوا۟ مَا تُؤْمَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They said, ‘Call on your Lord for us, to show us what sort of cow it should be.’ He answered, ‘God says it should be neither too old nor too young, but in between, so do as you are commanded.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱدْعُ","en_gloss":"Pray","transliteration":"ud'ʿu","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"(to) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُبَيِّن","en_gloss":"to make clear","transliteration":"yubayyin","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّنَا","en_gloss":"to us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هِىَ ۚ","en_gloss":"it (is)","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"says","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّهَا","en_gloss":"[Indeed] it","transliteration":"innahā","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَقَرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a cow","transliteration":"baqaratun","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَارِضٌۭ","en_gloss":"old","transliteration":"fāriḍun","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:68"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِكْرٌ","en_gloss":"young","transliteration":"bik'run","verse_key":"2:68"},{